# Screenshots here are generated OUTPUT, regenerated on every run and never
# byte-stable across Chromium builds or font stacks. ha_validate.sh section 7
# fails the build on any tracked binary outside docs/mockups/*.png — by design,
# "to stop a stray screenshot, export or backup being committed". So the
# directory is tracked and its contents are not.
#
# If visual-regression BASELINES are added later they must be un-ignored
# explicitly (e.g. !baseline-*.png) AND section 7's exception list widened to
# match, or the push will fail the gate.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
